      "text": "- maitains list strucutre, links between nodes\n* IFF Append-Only\n    - requires index to point to active records\n* IFF In-Place updates\n    - requires careful updates (shdow copying | CAS) \n    - or INNO-DB like behaviour, where we log redo first, then apply in-place update",
      "fontSize": 24.30058870027239,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- maitains list strucutre, links between nodes\n* IFF Append-Only\n    - requires index to point to active records\n* IFF In-Place updates\n    - requires careful updates (shdow copying | CAS) \n    - or INNO-DB like behaviour, where we log redo first, then apply in-place update",
